      "content": "You’re with the group when clattering hooves, surprised yelps, and frantic bleating break through the afternoon. A fluffy white sheep with a black face and curled horns bounds toward you, an ornate scroll clenched in its mouth.\n\nThe sheep waves the scroll toward the group as it approaches. Wild Sheep Danger Retest L1, what do you do?",
