      "role": "dm",
      "content": "The sheep’s bleating shifts into cultured Common, touched by an elven accent and the faintest bleat. “I am Finethir Shinebright—a wizard in urgent need of aid. I must recover an extremely powerful artifact from a dangerous, possibly insane wizard.”\n\nHe starts to explain, the ornate scroll still clenched in his mouth—but howling soon cuts across his story. The sheep turns toward the sound. What do you do?",
