    {
      "role": "dm",
      "content": "You step between Finethir and the approaching party, drawing your sword and holding your ground. The half-orc’s eyes settle on the blade, then return to the sheep. Three large, iron-collared wolves press through the crowd with him; behind them, a huge cloaked figure’s heavy footfalls rise over the angry shouts and howling.\n\n“That sheep is Master Noke’s,” the half-orc says, one hand still on his greatsword. “He desires to have it back.” Finethir stays behind you, the ornate scroll still in his mouth. The half-orc and his companions have come into view, and their demand hangs between you. What do you do?",
